      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOMETHING FOR LEXY (1) has been coming from wider barriers of late but should enjoy an economical run from the inside draw and placed in Brisbane the last time she started from there. TULHURST MAUREEN (10) is a lightly-raced but progressive filly who scored an easy maiden win here first up before a solid third last start, beaten less than 2 metres. Draws on the back row but with even luck she is good enough to win a race of this calibre. BIZZIE LIZZIE (6) faded after working last start but had some decent Queensland form prior so may be worth another chance. LUCKY PUNT (7) draws wide but has some good form under the belt including a win here two back.",
